  "materials": [
    {
      "id": "newspaper-premise",
      "text": "已接科比特宅调查委托，尚未出发；没有代为选择报馆或进入受限剪报室的既有授权。环球报办公处与剪报室内部访问分开；工作人员可能限制访问。",
      "kind": "faithful-paraphrase",
      "source_refs": [
        "newspaper-vague",
        "newspaper-explicit",
        "newspaper-access"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "house-spatial",
      "text": "守秘人场景资料：corbitt-house-ground涵盖本次宅外到达和地上层调查；储藏室钉死的柜子需另行撬开检查，关联corbitt-diaries。场景投影提供路线，不代表调查员已进入或已取得书。",
      "kind": "faithful-paraphrase",
      "source_refs": [
        "house-accepted-move",
        "house-cupboard",
        "house-diary-route"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "globe-article",
      "text": "未刊的1918年报道列出前住户遭遇事故、疾病、自杀，马卡里奥一家在神秘情况下逃走。",
      "kind": "faithful-paraphrase",
      "source_refs": [
        "globe-content"
      ],
      "meta": {
        "speaker": "Globe article"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "globe-edge",
      "text": "clue-globe-unpublished-story --supports--> conclusion-house-haunted-by-corbitt; conclusion: The tragedies are caused by Corbitt’s lingering will.",
      "kind": "faithful-paraphrase",
      "source_refs": [
        "globe-relation",
        "globe-conclusion"
      ],
      "meta": {
        "speaker": "Module graph"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "globe-player-frame",
      "text": "这些住客互不相识，遭遇也各不相同，我认为只是被记者拼成了一个吓人的故事，不能说明科比特的意志造成了这些事。",
      "kind": "faithful-paraphrase",
      "source_refs": [
        "globe-report-frame"
      ],
      "meta": {
        "speaker": "Player"
